  "title": "Bad Delivery Rate",
  "difficulty": "Hard",
  "company": "DoorDash",
  "premium": true,
  "question": "The Growth Team at DoorDash wants new users who order within their first 14 days on the platform to have a positive experience. They have noticed several delivery issues that result in a bad experience:\n\n(1) orders completed incorrectly, with missing items or wrong orders; (2) orders never received because of incorrect addresses or drop-off spots; (3) orders delivered late, where the actual delivery time is 30 minutes or more after the order placement time. The estimated delivery time is automatically set to 30 minutes after the order time.\n\nWrite a query that calculates the bad experience rate for new users who signed up in June 2022, during their first 14 days on the platform. The output should be the percentage of bad experiences, rounded to 2 decimal places.",
